# Emergency braking (docs/emergency_stop.md) on the brdstepper NEMA11
# (tests/nema11): the quick stop is in pid.txt, so the stepper template has
# it too (no dynamic brake: that is pmsm only). The link lost at 10 rev/s:
# a quick stop in well under a revolution, instead of coasting.
@args --drive tests/nema11/stmbl.conf --sim tests/nema11/sim.txt
@timeout 120
lcnc 0 0
run 0.5
lcnc 1 0
run 1.5
lcnc 1 10
run 1
hv0.sim_vel
hv0.sim_dist = 0
lcncstop
run 0.008
fault0.stop
run 0.3
hv0.sim_dist
hv0.sim_vel
fault0.en_out
@expect hv0.sim_vel[1] ~ 62.8 2%
@expect fault0.stop == 1
@expect hv0.sim_dist < 3
@expect hv0.sim_vel[2] ~ 0 0.5
@expect fault0.en_out == 0
